    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Human.</strong> Normalized BBTTCC ancestry root.</p><p>Select one heritage separately when building the character: <strong>Erectus, Florensis, Neanderthal</strong>.</p><p>This root grants the shared Human core trait package and preserves live UUID compatibility for existing feature items.</p><p><em>“Humanity is not special. It’s just stubborn enough to keep moving when reality begs it to stop.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Adaptive.</strong> Once per long rest, when you fail a saving throw, you can choose to succeed instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Tenacious.</strong> While you have 1 hit point, you have advantage on one check of your choice each round (declare before rolling).</p>\n<p><strong>Lineage Memory.</strong> Choose one human lineage (Neanderthal, Denisovan, Florensis, Erectus). Your lineage grants Tier powers as you level.</p><p class=\"ft-heritages-line\"><strong>Heritages:</strong> Cro-Magnon, Denisovan, Florensis, Neanderthal.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"humanAbilities\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #8aa4c2;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(45,65,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b8d0e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Abilities — <strong>Species Set</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.84rem;opacity:0.9\">Click this species feature to open the abilities picker.</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:0.35rem;padding:0.4rem 0.55rem;background:rgba(40,55,75,0.35);border-radius:0.25rem\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem\"><strong>Adaptive</strong></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.86;margin-top:0.15rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/long rest &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (on failed save)</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.15rem\">Treat a failed saving throw as a success.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:0.35rem;padding:0.4rem 0.55rem;background:rgba(40,55,75,0.35);border-radius:0.25rem\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem\"><strong>Tenacious</strong></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.86;margin-top:0.15rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/round (only at 1 HP) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Free (declare before roll)</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.15rem\">While at exactly 1 HP, advantage on one check of your choice each round.</div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
